{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X 的话与感受交替排列，视线需要上下切换，叙事连续性也不如 Y 左右分栏、完整句子的呈现方式。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 的【】突出每段真正重要的心理变化，感受又能随音乐实际出现的时点展开，既能抓住人物在想什么，也能感受到情绪如何一步步变化。尤其是怀念被当作自己人的亲近、害怕孤单、却不愿重新忍受委屈之间的区别，X 交代得更准确细腻，音乐感受也更具体。Y 的阅读路径和叙事连贯性更好，但部分感受被压缩成概括性词语，音乐中的细微转折及人物动机的层次有所损失。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "73b3d42f-a9ab-4dea-9692-5c1aaa491a39", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T194453960512Z", "elapsed_seconds": 89.844, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:46:23.802143+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f9953e2f7a6ed55f60cf77e6a5aeeef3c09f4af5982224e82fcafb46f8e1c82b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.p